---
import Divider from "./Divider.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/images/headshot.png";
import couple from "../assets/images/couple.jpg";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-sand-100 py-24 md:py-32">
  <Divider class="mb-16 text-ink-500/60" />
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-16 md:px-10">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-5" data-reveal>
        <img
          src={headshot.src}
          width="160"
          height="160"
          alt="Dr. Kebreab Hailegiorgis"
          class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-4 ring-sand-50 transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-110"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-xl text-ink-900">Dr. Kebreab Hailegiorgis</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-500">Relationship Coach</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="mt-10 max-w-sm" data-reveal>
        <img
          src={couple.src}
          width={couple.width}
          height={couple.height}
          loading="lazy"
          alt="Dr. Kebreab Hailegiorgis and his wife Ariam, smiling, seated together outdoors"
          class="aspect-4/5 w-full rounded-2xl object-cover object-top"
        />
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-500">Kebreab and Ariam</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="mb-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-forest-700" data-reveal>
        Why this work
      </p>
      <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-snug text-ink-900 md:text-3xl" data-reveal>
        Married for more than 25 years, Dr. Hailegiorgis and his wife Ariam
        learned to not only live together, but to live in harmony through
        their own struggles, conflicts, and disagreements along the way.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-ink-700" data-reveal>
        That experience, paired with rigorous academic research and
        training as a Certified MICA Practitioner and member of MINT
        (Motivational Interviewing Network of Trainers), is what he now
        shares with the people and organizations he works with: individuals,
        couples at every stage, and teams learning to navigate conflict and
        connection well.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
